{"suttaId":"tha-ap133","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[6022,6050],"vripara":"1"},"segments":{"tha-ap133:0.3":"Sobhitattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap133:1.1":"“Padumuttaro nāma jino, lokajeṭṭho narāsabho;","tha-ap133:1.3":"Mahato janakāyassa, deseti amataṃ padaṃ.","tha-ap133:2.1":"“Tassāhaṃ vacanaṃ sutvā, vācāsabhimudīritaṃ [vācāsabhimudīrayiṃ (?)];","tha-ap133:2.3":"Añjaliṃ paggahetvāna, ekaggo āsahaṃ tadā.","tha-ap133:3.1":"“Yathā samuddo udadhīnamaggo, nerū nagānaṃ pavaro siluccayo;","tha-ap133:3.3":"Tatheva ye cittavasena vattare, na buddhañāṇassa kalaṃ upenti te.","tha-ap133:4.1":"“Dhammavidhiṃ [dhamme vidhiṃ (sī.)] ṭhapetvāna, buddho kāruṇiko isi;","tha-ap133:4.3":"Bhikkhusaṅghe nisīditvā, imā gāthā abhāsatha.","tha-ap133:5.1":"“‘Yo so ñāṇaṃ pakittesi, buddhamhi lokanāyake;","tha-ap133:5.3":"Kappānaṃ satasahassaṃ, duggatiṃ na gamissati.","tha-ap133:6.1":"“‘Kilese jhāpayitvāna, ekaggo susamāhito;","tha-ap133:6.3":"Sobhito nāma nāmena, hessati satthu sāvako’.","tha-ap133:7.1":"“Paññāse kappasahasse, sattevāsuṃ yasuggatā [samuggatā (syā.)];","tha-ap133:7.3":"Sattaratanasampannā, cakkavattī mahabbalā.","tha-ap133:8.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ, bhavā sabbe samūhatā;","tha-ap133:8.3":"Tisso vijjā anuppattā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap133:9.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso, vimokkhāpi ca aṭṭhime;","tha-ap133:9.3":"Chaḷabhiññā sacchikatā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap133:10.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā sobhito thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap133:11.1":"Sobhitattherassāpadānaṃ paṭhamaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":2940,"to":2940,"paras":[{"para":2940,"vripara":"1","refs":["tha-ap133:1"],"lines":["So aparabhāge attano pubbakammaṃ saritvā somanassajāto pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>padumuttaro nāma jino</b>tiādimāha.","Taṃ sabbaṃ heṭṭhā vuttanayattā suviññeyyamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap133:1"],["tha-ap133:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap133:1.1","padumuttaro nāma jino",0,0]]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
